description	"Gadon Thek
 
Augmented Leader of the Hidden Beks, Master Of Stealth and Coorinating Ambushes.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% Percent Faster Movement Speed
- Gadon's Carbine (A280 Level 3)
-- 10%- Damage, 15%+ RoF, Mag Reload
- Vibrosaber
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- No Blaster Defense/Deflect

^8Attributes:
- Augmented Eyes (Sense 3)
- Enhanced Senses (Miraluka Sight))
- Cloak (2)
- Disguise (3)
- Blast Armor
- Tracking Beacon
- Anti MT (1)
- Environment Protection (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (1)
- Rally
- Call In Hidden Bek (Spawner ^3[CS4]
- Hidden Bek Bodyguard (Hidden Bek Round Spawn)

^8Abilities:
- Disguise (3) ^3[Change Style Button in MELEE]
- Optical Scan (Enemy Scanner) ^3[CS2]
- Dodge ^3[CS1]
- Cloak ^3[CS3]"
